---
import type { Lang } from '../i18n/ui';
import { BUDGET_DATE, BUDGET_MODELS, BUDGET_INPUT_RATE, BUDGET_OUTPUT_RATE, DEFAULT_USD_TWD, projectBudget } from '../lib/project-budget';
interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh-tw';
const estimate = projectBudget();
const amount = (range: readonly number[], currency: string) => `${currency} ${range.map(v => Math.round(v).toLocaleString('en-US')).join('–')}`;
const rows = [
  ['develop', zh ? '一次性 AI／API 開發' : 'One-time AI/API development'],
  ['annual', zh ? '每年更新與維運' : 'Annual updates and operation'],
  ['total', zh ? '開發＋首年維運合計' : 'Development + first year'],
] as const;
---
<section class="project-budget" id="project-budget" aria-labelledby="budget-title" data-budget-lang={lang}>
  <h2 id="budget-title">{zh ? '專案費用估算' : 'Project cost estimate'}</h2>
  <p>{zh ? '以公開 API 單價規劃整個教材與網站的開發、雙語修訂、程式驗證及後續維護。以下是用量情境估算，並非已支付帳單；目前沒有完整歷史 token 用量可供核算。' : 'A planning estimate for developing the course and website, bilingual revision, code verification, and ongoing upkeep at public API rates. These are usage scenarios, not paid invoices: complete historical token usage is unavailable.'}</p>
  <table class="budget-table">
    <caption>{zh ? '預算範圍；開發費用只計一次，維運費用按年計' : 'Planning range; development is one-time and maintenance is annual'}</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">{zh ? '項目' : 'Item'}</th><th scope="col">USD</th><th scope="col">{zh ? '約新台幣' : 'Approx. TWD'}</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{rows.map(([key, label]) => <tr class:list={{ total: key === 'total' }}>
      <th scope="row">{label}</th>
      <td data-budget-value={`${key}-usd`}>{amount(estimate[key].usd, 'US$')}</td>
      <td data-budget-value={`${key}-twd`}>{amount(estimate[key].twd, 'NT$')}</td>
    </tr>)}</tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="budget-note">{zh ? '價格查核：' : 'Prices checked: '}{BUDGET_DATE}{zh ? '。預設 1 USD＝32 TWD，僅作預算換算，並非即時匯率。範圍代表不同用量假設，不是統計信賴區間。' : '. Default conversion: 1 USD = 32 TWD, a planning assumption rather than a live exchange rate. The range represents usage scenarios, not a statistical confidence interval.'}</p>
  <details>
    <summary>{zh ? '計算方式、用量假設與來源' : 'Calculation, usage assumptions, and sources'}</summary>
    <form class="budget-controls" hidden data-budget-controls>
      <label>{zh ? 'AI 用量倍數' : 'AI usage multiplier'}<input name="scale" type="number" min="0" max="20" step="0.25" value="1" required inputmode="decimal" /></label>
      <label>{zh ? '換算匯率（TWD／USD）' : 'Planning TWD per USD'}<input name="exchange" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000" step="0.01" value={DEFAULT_USD_TWD} required inputmode="decimal" /></label>
      <button type="reset">{zh ? '重設' : 'Reset'}</button>
    </form>
    <p role="status" class="budget-status" data-budget-status></p>
    <p>{zh ? '單次開發預留 5,000 萬–1.5 億輸入 token、1,000 萬–3,000 萬計費輸出 token，包含撰寫、修訂、重試與推理用量。年度維護假設每月另用 100 萬–500 萬輸入、20 萬–100 萬輸出 token。這些用量是規劃額度，並非由文章字數反推的實測紀錄。' : 'Development allows 50–150 million input tokens and 10–30 million billed output tokens, covering drafting, revision, retries, and reasoning usage. Annual maintenance assumes another 1–5 million input and 0.2–1 million output tokens per month. These are planning allowances, not measurements inferred from published word counts.'}</p>
    <table class="budget-table">
      <caption>{zh ? '假設輸入與輸出都依同一比例分配；每百萬 token 的美元單價' : 'Assumed allocation for both input and output; USD per million tokens'}</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">{zh ? '模型' : 'Model'}</th><th scope="col">{zh ? '比例' : 'Share'}</th><th scope="col">{zh ? '輸入／輸出' : 'Input / output'}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{BUDGET_MODELS.map(m => <tr><th scope="row">{m.name}</th><td>{m.share * 100}%</td><td>{m.input} / {m.output}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
    <p>{zh ? `加權單價為每百萬輸入 US$${BUDGET_INPUT_RATE.toFixed(2)}、輸出 US$${BUDGET_OUTPUT_RATE.toFixed(2)}。開發＝token 費用 × 1.25；年度維運＝（12 個月的更新 token 費用＋US$20–100 網域分攤與額外工具預留）× 1.25。首年合計只加一次開發費，25% 為預備額。用量倍數僅調整 token 額度。` : `Weighted rates are US$${BUDGET_INPUT_RATE.toFixed(2)} per million input tokens and US$${BUDGET_OUTPUT_RATE.toFixed(2)} per million output tokens. Development = token cost × 1.25. Annual operation = (12 months of update tokens + a US$20–100 allowance for shared domain costs and extra tools) × 1.25. The first-year total adds development once; 25% is contingency. The multiplier changes token allowances only.`}</p>
    <p>{zh ? '本站採靜態頁面，讀者瀏覽不呼叫模型 API。符合免費方案限制時，Cloudflare Pages 靜態資源請求費用為 US$0；網域與工具預留不是供應商報價。模型費用採 Standard／一般短情境文字 API 價，未套用快取與批次折扣。長情境、加速方案、額外工具呼叫與影像／影片生成可能另計。' : 'The site serves static pages; reading does not call a model API. Within free-plan limits, Cloudflare Pages static-asset requests cost US$0. The domain/tool allowance is not a vendor quote. Model costs use standard short-context text API rates without caching or batch discounts. Long context, faster service tiers, extra tool calls, and image/video generation may add costs.'}</p>
    <p>{zh ? '不含人工審稿、設備與稅金。若以 ChatGPT／Claude 訂閱取得開發額度，應改用實際訂閱及超額帳單核算，不把同一用量的 API 等值估算再重複加上。取得完整使用紀錄後，應以實際帳單更新本估算。' : 'Human review, equipment, and taxes are excluded. If development uses ChatGPT/Claude subscription allowances, use subscription and overage invoices instead of adding the API-equivalent estimate for the same usage again. Replace this estimate with actual billing when complete records are available.'}</p>
    <p class="budget-sources"><a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing">OpenAI API pricing</a> · <a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing">Claude API pricing</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/functions/pricing/">Cloudflare Pages pricing</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/platform/limits/">Cloudflare Pages limits</a></p>
  </details>
</section>
<script>
  import { projectBudget } from '../lib/project-budget';
  const section = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.project-budget');
  const form = section?.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('form');
  if (section && form) {
    const zh = section.dataset.budgetLang === 'zh-tw';
    const status = section.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-budget-status]')!;
    const update = () => {
      if (!form.checkValidity()) { status.textContent = zh ? '請輸入範圍內的有效數值。' : 'Enter valid values within the displayed limits.'; return; }
      const scale = (form.elements.namedItem('scale') as HTMLInputElement).valueAsNumber;
      const exchange = (form.elements.namedItem('exchange') as HTMLInputElement).valueAsNumber;
      const values = projectBudget(scale, exchange);
      for (const phase of ['develop', 'annual', 'total'] as const) {
        for (const currency of ['usd', 'twd'] as const) {
          const cell = section.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-budget-value="${phase}-${currency}"]`)!;
          cell.textContent = `${currency === 'usd' ? 'US$' : 'NT$'} ${values[phase][currency].map(v => Math.round(v).toLocaleString('en-US')).join('–')}`;
        }
      }
      status.textContent = zh ? `已按 ${scale} 倍 AI 用量、1 USD＝${exchange} TWD 重新估算。` : `Updated for ${scale}× AI usage and 1 USD = ${exchange} TWD.`;
    };
    form.hidden = false;
    form.addEventListener('submit', event => event.preventDefault());
    form.addEventListener('input', update);
    form.addEventListener('reset', () => requestAnimationFrame(update));
  }
</script>
<style>
  .project-budget { margin-block: 2.5rem; }
  .budget-table { display: table; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font: 14px/1.6 var(--f-ui); }
  .budget-table caption { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .budget-table th, .budget-table td { padding: 10px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .budget-table th { text-align: left; font-weight: 500; }
  .budget-table td { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .budget-table .total > * { font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); }
  .budget-note, .budget-sources, .budget-status { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  details { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  summary { min-height: 44px; padding: 12px 0; cursor: pointer; font: 600 15px/1.6 var(--f-ui); }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .budget-controls:not([hidden]) { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: 12px; margin-block: 16px; }
  .budget-controls label { display: grid; gap: 6px; flex: 1 1 150px; font: 13px var(--f-ui); }
  input, button { min-height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); padding: 8px 10px; font: 15px var(--f-ui); }
  input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  button { cursor: pointer; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .budget-table { font-size: 12px; } .budget-table th, .budget-table td { padding-inline: 4px; } }
</style>
